From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Say when the desktop refuses to show a 3D video in 3D
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS (ORDER 453)
Forwarded: no
Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code

Qt Multimedia's Video declares the video to the desktop before it attaches anything; when the declaration is refused it draws the ordinary picture and says why in stereoLayerFailure (qt6-multimedia +stereo3d15, patch 0046). Plank Player shows that reason over the video, with the sentence in the nine languages.
---
--- a/app/qml/main.qml	2026-11-09 19:13:09.426154517 -0300
+++ psrc/plank-player-5.27.80+git20261005.f87e775/app/qml/main.qml	2026-11-09 19:13:58.869596117 -0300
@@ -90,6 +90,26 @@
             }
         }
 
+        Rectangle {
+            id: stereoLayerFailureBanner
+            visible: video.stereoLayerFailure.length > 0
+            anchors.top: parent.top
+            anchors.left: parent.left
+            anchors.right: parent.right
+            height: failureText.implicitHeight + 16
+            color: Kirigami.Theme.neutralBackgroundColor
+            border.color: Kirigami.Theme.neutralTextColor
+            border.width: 1
+            Controls.Label {
+                id: failureText
+                anchors.fill: parent
+                anchors.margins: 8
+                wrapMode: Text.WordWrap
+                color: Kirigami.Theme.textColor
+                text: i18nc("@info %1 is the reason the desktop gave", "This video is shown flat: the desktop refused to show it in 3D (%1).", video.stereoLayerFailure)
+            }
+        }
+
         PlayerOSD {
             id: playerOSDItem
             anchors.bottom: parent.bottom
--- a/po/de/plank-player.po	2026-10-04 23:17:18.000000000 -0300
+++ psrc/plank-player-5.27.80+git20261005.f87e775/po/de/plank-player.po	2026-11-09 19:13:58.870121858 -0300
@@ -27,3 +27,7 @@
 #, kde-format
 msgid "Press 'esc' or the [←] Back button to close"
 msgstr "Drücken Sie zum Schließen die Taste „Esc“ oder [←] „Zurück“"
+
+msgctxt "@info %1 is the reason the desktop gave"
+msgid "This video is shown flat: the desktop refused to show it in 3D (%1)."
+msgstr "Dieses Video wird flach gezeigt: Der Desktop hat die Darstellung in 3D abgelehnt (%1)."
